    "abstract": "This document defines the real-time transport of audio and video fingerprints used for audio to video timing measurement. These fingerprints and their containerization is defined in SMPTE ST 2064-1. Transport methods are defined for Serial Digital Interfaces (SDI), User Datagram Protocol (UDP) over Internet Protocol (IP), and MPEG-2 Transport Stream.",
